    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like i've hit a wall. like, not just a slump, but a literal ceiling. everything i write now just feels like a hollow imitation of what i used to be able to do. it’s actually painful to even pick up my instrument because i know i’ll never reach that peak again. i can feel the decline happening in real time.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
