    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it doesn't feel temporary though. it feels permanent. it's like i can see the trajectory and it's just a slow, pathetic slide into being nothing. there's no \"new door,\" there's just the reality that the spark is dead. honestly, i'd rather stop now while i'm still \"something\" than live to see myself become a joke of what i once was.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
